# In a Limited game a sideboard holds any number of basic lands (Magic Tournament Rules; North Wind Avatar's ruling: "In Limited
# events, your sideboard also includes an arbitrary number of basic lands"). Bot1's sideboard is its Opt and the event's basics,
# here Island and Mountain. The first Avatar brings in a Mountain, and another Mountain is still outside the game; the second Avatar
# brings in a Mountain again. Bot1 ends with two Mountains in hand and its sideboard as it began: Opt, Island and Mountain.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
North Wind Avatar
Mountain
Island
North Wind Avatar
Island x10

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Opt

[Basic Lands Outside]
Island
Mountain

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
? Bot1.Sideboard = Opt; Island; Mountain
? Bot2.Sideboard = Island; Mountain
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.North Wind Avatar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
? Bot1.Sideboard = Opt; Island; Mountain
? Bot1.Hand = Island; Mountain
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.North Wind Avatar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Sideboard = Opt; Island; Mountain
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Mountain
Bot2.Sideboard = Island; Mountain
